On Wed, 5 May 2004, David Damerell wrote:

> I wouldn't go that far, but I think it would only work well for comparison
> of preprogrammed long-term strategies - long-term strategy being the one
> thing that the Angband Borg and Rogue-O-Matic do not really have to do.
